}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(130-3{x}_{i}^{2}-5{y}_{j}^{2})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $130-3{x}_{i}^{2}-5{y}_{j}^{2}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345074 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152154 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "bd33f89c-3adc-5b57-b7b7-4877a9e54e11" :knowledge-point/title "Writing the Lower Riemann Sum for a Strictly Decreasing Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "30a438fa-b506-5e20-a80e-399b21483bc0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "50-4{x}_{i}^{2}-11{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186342644} {:answer/id #uuid "5e3559a5-c825-5660-a9c9-a1774cd39b37" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "50-4{x}_{i}^{2}-11{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343028} {:answer/id #uuid "7453c105-17ce-547a-9be5-e66e97ea72f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}_{i}^{2}+3{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343244} {:answer/id #uuid "a7f242cc-de98-5b7d-a6fe-cea7e5d15264" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}_{i}^{2}+3{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343715} {:answer/id #uuid "d0ccfc21-9102-51dc-83f4-af170a758e28" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "50-4{x}_{i-1}^{2}-11{y}_{j-1}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344072}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5e3559a5-c825-5660-a9c9-a1774cd39b37" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "50-4{x}_{i}^{2}-11{y}_{j}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343028} :answer-field/id #uuid "8389091e-86ba-5cb6-a909-8ebcb446553a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/ty